id: DRAFT-yatm-0.9-shared-symbol-export-link-order
title: 传递共享库导出同名符号导致链接顺序抢占与未签名 NEEDED 依赖，需要把静态提供者前置并用 --as-needed
trigger_tool: clang|ld|cmake|conan
phase: linking|runtime
error_signature: Error loading shared library libpulse-simple\.so\.0.*needed by.*yatm|Error relocating.*yatm: sf_open_fd: symbol not found|Error relocating.*yatm: sf_seek: symbol not found|Error relocating.*yatm: sf_readf_float: symbol not found
severity: 2
category: link|conan|cmake|runtime
match_keywords: link order, shared symbol export, as-needed, libpulsecommon, libsndfile, static before shared, NEEDED, symbol not found
root_cause: Conan 依赖图把传递共享库 libpulsecommon-17.0.so 放在静态 libsndfile.a 之前，且该共享库导出了 sf_* 符号；链接器按首次命中解析，导致本应由静态归档提供的符号被共享库抢占，未使用的 pulse 依赖也被写入 NEEDED，运行期因未签名共享库加载失败
affected_scope: 使用 Conan + CMake/ld 且存在“目标静态依赖符号被传递共享库导出”的任何包
verification_cmd: BIN=$(find "$HOME/.conan2/p" -path "*/yatm*/p/bin/yatm" -type f | sort | tail -1); PULSE=$(find "$HOME/.conan2/p" -name "libpulsecommon-17.0.so" | head -1); readelf -d "$BIN" | grep NEEDED; nm -D "$PULSE" | grep -E "sf_open_fd|sf_seek|sf_readf_float"
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: static-first-as-needed
rec_description: 把真正提供符号的静态依赖放在传递共享库之前，并追加 -Wl,--as-needed 剔除未被引用的共享库
rec_command: target_link_libraries(yatm ${SNDFILE_LIBRARIES} ${MAD_LIBRARIES} ${OGG_LIBRARIES} ${SLANG_LIBRARIES} ${SOUNDTOUCH_LIBRARIES} ${SPEEX_LIBRARIES} ${AO_LIBRARIES}); toolchain.extra_exelinkflags.append("-Wl,--as-needed")
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: patch + recipe
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: explicit-symbol-provider
fallback_description: 若不能改变全局链接顺序，用完整路径或链接分组把静态提供者提前，或拆分依赖图
fallback_command: target_link_libraries(yatm ${SNDFILE_LIBRARIES} ... ${AO_LIBRARIES})
fallback_auto_fix: false
fallback_impl: patch
forbid_1_pattern: 把 AO_LIBRARIES（含 pulse 共享库）放在 SNDFILE_LIBRARIES 之前
forbid_1_reason: 会再次让 libpulsecommon 抢占 sf_* 符号
forbid_1_consequence: NEEDED 混入未签名 pulse 库，运行期 rc=127
principles: 链接顺序决定符号提供者；共享库导出的符号会抢先满足后续静态库需求
caused_by: Conan/CMake 拉平依赖并把传递共享库放在目标前
causes: 运行期未签名共享库加载失败与 symbol not found
similar_to: E537,E669,DRAFT-json-parser-1.1.0-cmakedeps-dual-lib-form-symbol-not-found
conflicts_with: 依赖必须以共享库形态交付且不能被剔除的场景
prerequisite_of:
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-yatm-0.9-shared-symbol-export-link-order.md
last_updated: 2026-10-02
source_event: yatm 0.9 OHOS 适配：libpulsecommon 抢占 libsndfile 符号 → 链接顺序 + --as-needed 修复 → CI PASS
authors: songzhenyan
source_pr: 14051
source_commit: f5112ea461
metrics_success_count: 1
metrics_fail_count: 0
metrics_confidence: 1.0
metrics_last_used: 2026-10-02
